    <sys:String x:Key="FB.LowLatency" xml:space="preserve">Low latency mode</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="FB.LowLatencyHint" xml:space="preserve">Less input lag, softer generated frames. Frames are shown as soon as they are ready instead of being spaced out, and they are built at half resolution. Measured: about 9 ms less delay from the spacing and 2–3 ms from the lighter work, most of it where the picture moves fastest.</sys:String>
